  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to paste; to stick on; to attach",
      "explanation": "To affix something to a surface using adhesive, or to paste digital content."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06855_haritsukeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{壁|かべ}にポスターを{貼|は}り{付|つ}けた。",
      "english": "I stuck a poster on the wall.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06855_haritsukeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "コピーした{文章|ぶんしょう}をメールに{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける。",
      "english": "To paste the copied text into an email.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06855_haritsukeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{切手|きって}を{封筒|ふうとう}に{貼|は}り{付|つ}けてください。",
      "english": "Please stick the stamp on the envelope.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "CONJUGATION:\n・{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける → {貼|は}り{付|つ}けない (negative)\n・{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける → {貼|は}り{付|つ}けて (te-form)\n・{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける → {貼|は}り{付|つ}けた (past)\n\nFORMATION:\nCompound verb: {貼|は}る (to stick) + {付|つ}ける (to attach)\n\nUSAGE:\n・シールを{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける (to stick on a sticker)\n・{写真|しゃしん}を{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける (to paste a photo)\n・リンクを{貼|は}り{付|つ}ける (to paste a link)\n\nIn computing contexts, often abbreviated to just {貼|は}る or ペーストする.\n\nKANJI NOTE:\nCan also be written as {張|は}り{付|つ}ける, though {貼|は}り{付|つ}ける is more common for sticking/pasting.",
